Stacks on turnip-force-fp16.patch. Adds an opt-in GAMMA_FP16_VERTEX env that
extends the forced-fp16 demotion to VERTEX shaders (default OFF). Vertex fp16 is
a modest ~+4% win on vertex-ALU-bound content but is NOT default-on in ULTRA
because demoting gl_Position math to fp16 can cause geometry wobble / z-fighting
on real content. Opt-in for vertex-bound titles known to tolerate it.

--- a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c
+++ b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c
@@ ir3_optimize_loop: fp16 stage gate
    if (os_get_option("GAMMA_FP16") &&
        (s->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_FRAGMENT ||
-        (s->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_COMPUTE && os_get_option("GAMMA_FP16_COMPUTE"))))
+        (s->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_COMPUTE && os_get_option("GAMMA_FP16_COMPUTE")) ||
+        (s->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_VERTEX && os_get_option("GAMMA_FP16_VERTEX"))))
       NIR_PASS(_, s, nir_lower_bit_size, gamma_fp16_bit_size_cb, NULL);
